      "content": "\u25b2 Fixed the issue of \"777\" magnification and unlocking achievement in the fruit machine during shaking\n\u25b2 Fix the issue of excessive spider health\n\u25b2 Fixed the issue of being able to pick up items in Bo Xi\n\u25b2 Fix the problem of detonators not exploding immediately when thrown out and encountering monsters\n\u25b2 Fixed the issue where changing microphone input devices sometimes does not take effect\n\u25b2 Fixed the issue of not being able to play emoji animations when using the controller\nAdjusting trees or stones that have been hit by a car will no longer cause collisions with the car\nAdjusting the buried area around the car will bounce it up, making it easier for the car to get out of trouble\n\u25b2 Adjust and reduce the total number of monsters in level four or five underground palaces\n\u25b2 Adjust the prices of some items\n\u25b2 Adjust monster respawn time\n\u25b2 Adjusting the monsters in the wild will make them relatively dispersed\nAdjusting the speed of time passing will slow down as the map level increases",
